ny Switch (rgthree)","cat":"util","x":2640,"y":7932,"inputs":[{"name":"any_01","type":"AUDIO"},{"name":"any_02","type":"AUDIO"}],"outputs":[{"name":"*","type":"AUDIO"}],"widgets":[],"brief":"首帧与尾帧两个 LoadImage 只让启用的一路图像通过","desc":""},{"id":"270","title":"Video Source Selection","type":"Any Switch (rgthree)","cat":"util","x":2544,"y":7980,"inputs":[{"name":"any_01","type":"IMAGE"},{"name":"any_02","type":"IMAGE"}],"outputs":[{"name":"*","type":"IMAGE"}],"widgets":[],"brief":"首帧与尾帧两个 LoadImage 只让启用的一路图像通过","desc":""},{"id":"381","title":"1. Turn both it & Single Pass ON in the Options.\\n2. Load your video, using the blue selector bar to determine the start/end time ranges.\\n   - the left side (beginning) is where your video will start after being stitched together.\\n   - the right side (end) is where your gen will continue from.\\n   (IDEALLY your video is 24 FPS and already the correct size/aspect ratio,\\n   as mismatched video can result in imperfect continuations!)\\n3. Select Overlap Frames (5, 22, 39, or 56). This is the # of frames Minimax\\n     has access to as reference for how to continue your video.\\n4. Select whether your video has audio or not. Must select one option.\\n5. Since this is Single Pass, change your video genning settings:\\n   - Increase steps to 10+\\n   - Increase megapixels to 0.6-1.0\\n   - Turn off Previews #2 and #3\\n   - Turn off Final Upscale Pass\\n6. Prompt! Remember that the first 5-39 frames of your gen are SPOKEN FOR!\\n   In order to get seamless continuation, start with\\n   \"a continuous shot from beginning to end\" and then describe what's happening\\n   in a way that the model will understand how it can continue the shot.\\n\\nSeamless Video Continuation is for changing existing videos, and for creating\\nsingle-take shots longer than 15s. It is not a replacement for video editing, and if you\\ncan get away with cuts then just use normal genning practices with references to your\\nprevious shots/scenes.\\n\\nThe more overlap frames, the slower the gen (go figure).","type":"Label (rgthree)","cat":"util","x":2244,"y":6936,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"widgets":[],"brief":"rgthree 标签：画布上写说明文字。","desc":""},{"id":"171","title":"fc72fed4-8bc4-4873-9164-c09cc633cce6","type":"fc72fed4-8bc4-4873-9164-c09cc633cce6","cat":"util","x":2040,"y":4800,"inputs":[],"outputs":[{"name":"VAE","type":"VAE"},{"name":"VAE_1","type":"VAE"},{"name":"CLIP","type":"CLIP"},{"name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL"}],"widgets":["minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetens…","qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors","minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors","minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors"],"brief":"社区自定义节点（fc72fed4-8bc4-4873-9164-c09cc633cce6），具体用法见其项目文档。","desc":""},{"id":"145","title":"Select Latent to proceed to Finalization","type":"Fast Groups Bypasser (rgthree)","cat":"util","x":4860,"y":4872,"inputs":[],"outputs":[{"name":"OPT_CONNECTION","type":"*"}],"widgets":[],"brief":"按组一键旁路，切风格 LoRA 与模型通道","desc":""},{"id":"162","title":"Audio Refs + Custom Audio Option","type":"Fast Groups Bypasser (rgthree)","cat":"util","x":3768,"y":7320,"inputs":[],"outputs":[{"name":"OPT_CONNECTION","type":"*"}],"widgets":[],"brief":"按组一键旁路，切风格 LoRA 与模型通道","desc":""},{"id":"333","title":"⏸ Power Lora Loader (rgthree)","type":"Power Lora Loader (rgthree)","cat":"load","x":7200,"y":6936,"inputs":[],"outputs":[{"name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL"},{"name":"CLIP","type":"CLIP"}],"widgets":["","type: PowerLoraLoaderHeaderWidget","",""],"brief":"预置 6 个 LoRA 位，当前全部关闭待启用","desc":""},{"id":"152","title":"⏸ LoadImageCrop","type":"LoadImageCrop","cat":"load","x":4428,"y":6564,"inputs":[],"outputs":[{"name":"image","type":"IMAGE"},{"name":"mask","type":"MASK"}],"widgets":["","","1","image"],"brief":"社区自定义节点（LoadImageCrop），具体用法见其项目文档。","desc":""},{"id":"151","title":"⏸ LoadImageCrop","type":"LoadImageCrop","cat":"load","x":4104,"y":6564,"inputs":[],"outputs":[{"name":"image","type":"IMAGE"},{"name":"mask","type":"MASK"}],"widgets":["","",